AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; My name is Jev. &gt;&gt; And this is a huge deal because large language models have one fatal flaw. They won\'t shut the hell up. You give Fable or Astra a simple instruction like return true or false, and it\'ll discover a third option after thinking for 4,000'

[00:38] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: "TYPESAFE AI MODEL" UI with confidence levels and thresholds, showing a grid of grayscale squares
